{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "6233ed1757b2b87b5a823cea2d5f58c358fd9abb67c0b75b434960ba661da50b", "ja": "新たな希望！　託された未来！！", "zh": "新的希望！寄予厚望的未来！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b626855b4380f277db899c98fe64c8341dae04a9798627cfd5e9449689fc087d", "ja": "平凡な文学少女・百合子にヒーローの素質を\n見出したあずさは、百合子の覚醒を阻止しよ\nうとするジョーカー卿と再び戦闘に。\n満身創痍のあずさがピンチに陥ったその時、\n百合子はヒーローとして覚醒したのだった！", "zh": "在平凡的文学少女·百合子身上发现英雄资质\n的梓，与企图阻止百合子觉醒的\n小丑卿再次交战。\n就在遍体鳞伤的梓陷入危机的那一刻，\n百合子作为英雄觉醒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "4c46f252450a503d973e2a36128e1a282552f9868cb772c25cb0e3c67a3c00d0", "ja": "ジョーカー卿との戦いの数日前のことである。", "zh": "这是与Joker卿交战前几天的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "84ffcdd484039988f5b3d865daa3ffd1ae47e7cb59f85f0cdffd2479027bd297", "ja": "その頃、彼女はごく平凡な、\n臆病な文学少女に過ぎなかった。しかし……", "zh": "那时，她不过是一个非常普通、胆小的文学少女。然而……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "09ecaef0af0cecf9f977c7ec4a61b942d0519212f495189eebe9de2179b58739", "ja": "ふう、早く帰らなくちゃ。道草してたら、\nデストルドーに出くわしちゃうかも……、え？", "zh": "呼，得赶紧回去了。要是再在路上磨蹭，\n说不定会碰上Destiny……，咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1003_se", "source_sha256": "e35bfb8890719e1a68f254b737ebf3c073fa9e92b3d606bf968d5ae715ab28d6", "ja": "ドゴォーーーーーン！！", "zh": "轰——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "bb1be71f26a179251671d7c8657724c545f8cf463f3d4915d9d385c97a3b3572", "ja": "待ちなさい！　これ以上の乱暴は、\nマイティセーラーあずさが許さないわ！　やあっ！", "zh": "住手！我不许你再继续胡作非为了，\n水手力量梓绝不轻饶！呀啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1005_desutorugundan", "source_sha256": "70316ac147984d846da8d6acf79565fec2a9bf82caa0bd6daed045a8f2db9274", "ja": "ぐはぁっ！　……おのれっ、また貴様か！\nくそっ、覚えていろ、マイティセーラー！", "zh": "呜啊！……可恶，又是你！  \n该死，给我记住，Mighty Sailor！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "9f0a98e66ab49de1cd7dae8846089a2f12f6c53bc5fef5c5c2d90012d078c1dc", "ja": "何度でも、あなた達デストルドーの企みは、\n私達がすべて、阻んでみせます！", "zh": "不管多少次，你们德斯特尔多的阴谋，我们都会全部阻止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "16bae44a043f1535a343331b1b82ffdb6ed641cb44fb2571f49d1c808002be77", "ja": "マイティセーラー？　……あれが、ヒーロー？", "zh": "强袭水手？……那就是英雄？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "3e3ebc83109e2110fe4cceacb630d9f75445e218f4771dd1e4bb7d3328f9f687", "ja": "（なんだろう、すごくドキドキする！　\n私、どうしちゃったの？　……まさかこれが、恋！？）", "zh": "（这是怎么回事，好紧张啊！我这是怎么了？……难道这就是，恋爱！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "2276699a579ee4ee092246bd5427317a583107d4ec0cf0bce3100973422f0ff3", "ja": "（！？　この胸の高鳴り……。\nはっ。もしかして、あの子……？）", "zh": "（！？这阵心跳……。啊，难道是那个孩子……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1010_president", "source_sha256": "7490162c4905ace056bd8b48c8e8f24d85ca0170da07f555ad4b0634cdc1ee87", "ja": "ヒーローの素養を持つ少女が？", "zh": "拥有英雄资质的少女？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "caa6bf323ef5e0cd702197a5ccefe97b169e4a0ede7e00d3de84d0e5cb7f54ae", "ja": "はい。おそらく私のキネティックパワーと共鳴を。\nでも、まだ中学生ぐらいの女の子で……。", "zh": "是的。恐怕会与我的动能之力产生共鸣……但是，她还只是个初中生年纪的女孩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "274ab9989620c75fbe8fa3e94a4c3f9aeff114f53a9b40171dc31b76f557f963", "ja": "こんな過酷な戦いに巻き込むのは酷です。\nできれば、そっとしておいてあげたいと思っています。", "zh": "把她卷入如此残酷的战斗，实在太过分了。\n如果可以的话，我想让她静静地待着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1013_president", "source_sha256": "65986982d200a36203ce5e2ae3bc77ac09bd2803a313eea3c84c4b6e02c8d36b", "ja": "うむ……そうだな……。", "zh": "嗯……是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1014_president", "source_sha256": "76f9a1da40857547b301c8676b00e527bff9e57683f0d1ec2af9c0a8b1201b2e", "ja": "聞いていたかね、莉緒君。\nあずさ君の言うことはもっともだ。", "zh": "你听见了吗，莉绪君。\n梓君说得很有道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1015_president", "source_sha256": "86e39b05118a3d14d89e651cb2ca4824f929a572b4f98b80eed6fc033d3c5b81", "ja": "しかし、事態は悪化している。ヒーローの力はますます\n必要とされるだろう。歌織君も失った今、我々は……。", "zh": "然而，事态正在恶化。我们将越来越需要英雄的力量。如今连歌织也失去了，我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "fc72f674438d93602bc184f7c0046739aa23f951740a12aa035ba183a39a9105", "ja": "ええ。あずさちゃん、きっとこれからも一人で\n無理をしてしまう。それは……それだけは……。", "zh": "是啊。小梓今后一定还会独自勉强自己。那样……唯独那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "3b35452a128e60182b8f2f249f45c736c0a57c02fc9804f6e24a7d8832e5a358", "ja": "莉緒と高木は、あずさが見つけた少女・百合子への\n接触を試みようとしていた。", "zh": "莉緒和高木，正试图接触梓发现的少女·百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "e9e37840959654dd839e68212590b4f7e19ad84abe0beabeea814bf0256c8ede", "ja": "だが果たせないまま、高木はジョーカー卿の虚無と\n引き換えに、倒れたのであった。", "zh": "然而还没能实现，高木便以乔克卿的虚无为代价，倒下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "31c25bc06ec5bbb3485eca31a941406b3d24f3188c7aa5272a3c24ecd98b498a", "ja": "そして、現在――", "zh": "然后，来到现在——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "5fe98787ecac0ffa4cfc9c52d064e403e00782ed80017107c3f521901955d548", "ja": "一度撤退したジョーカー卿が、莉緒よりも先に、\n百合子の中に眠るキネティックパワーを察知していた！", "zh": "曾一度撤退的Joker卿，比莉绪更早察觉到了沉睡在百合子体内的动能！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "725cc84b932db71785b830d9325507756314d664d5578acc13b809a363e78fe2", "ja": "初めまして、戦士の卵さん。私はジョーカー卿。\nお会いできて光栄です。ところで……。", "zh": "初次见面，战士新人。我是Joker卿。能与您见面，我深感荣幸。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "166a82d6a620e27fbead537ed3912aa240ccfaad9aefbdbbd09226b60cd01911", "ja": "貴女、暗黒にご興味はありませんか？", "zh": "您对黑暗感兴趣吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "072e45ecbcce1f714809524a85ce644875268835f7af0b49add60d31e8996e0a", "ja": "な、何ですか、急に？　来ないで……いやあぁ！", "zh": "怎、怎么了，突然这样？别过来……不要啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1024_se", "source_sha256": "c3071a885dfee36aeeb81705399c643d7c4181d9cf093bb8cbadf343fca60d45", "ja": "ザシュッ！！", "zh": "唰——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "6a54168d64fbe4ae1886bd45c9ba925bbed897f3131a73a902f991ccc815301d", "ja": "離れなさい、ジョーカー卿！\nこの子に近づかないで！", "zh": "快离开，Joker卿！不许靠近这个孩子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "14337e6a495c913ed418523fb235ab441c1e1c3dded7221e98d4dd2e5b8e9857", "ja": "あっ！　あなたは、あの時の……！（ドキドキ）", "zh": "啊！你是那时候的……！（心怦怦跳）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "64ad4ebfd62b018551243ebf5cc844d53107f6f699954c8550311ef602fa488d", "ja": "急いで逃げなさい。貴女はデストルドーに\n近づいてはダメ。ここは私に任せて。", "zh": "快逃。你绝对不能靠近\n死之本能。这里就交给我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "ae7015522ed52a7582562bbb59104eeab6ef9783690d7e15e67870fe0deb72cf", "ja": "これは、マイティセーラー。いい機会です。\n今度こそ、息の根を止めてさしあげましょう。", "zh": "这就是Mighty Sailor。正是个好机会。这次就让我彻底解决你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1029_se", "source_sha256": "42dca8749f095b16aa1114c4ac42357884c96f5f7e22e0e9d693275a58db1a63", "ja": "ザシュザシュ！　ガキーン！！", "zh": "唰唰！锵——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "b5a491a51d73932ee7e57168b6b6fbf0483aa478888a42cde16adc1dc8a260d2", "ja": "う……っ！", "zh": "呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1031_044miz", "source_sha256": "f7d702dff644865e4c40b67156695d54dbd671dca1dc04b3985e30d87892f19f", "ja": "先日の傷もまだ癒えていないのに、頑張りますね。\n使命ですか？　本当に無駄、無意味なものです。", "zh": "前几天的伤还没痊愈，你却还真是努力呢。  \n这是使命吗？真是徒劳又毫无意义的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "0a871422d5c77ef335ca94462b834900fb4a507c2995f89e92d0e5e161669b50", "ja": "ど……どうしよう！　このままだとヒーローが……\n私に、あの人みたいな力があれば……でも……。", "zh": "怎……怎么办！这样下去的话，英雄他……\n要是我也有那个人一样的力量……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "cb5ea41f3eda434388798f0fba8ed0370cca35c6e9bc0d2b78e4fc1372b5ff22", "ja": "己の無力を嘆く百合子の前に、ついに百合子の力を\n察知して駆けつけた莉緒が現れる……。", "zh": "在因自身的无力而叹息的百合子面前，察觉到了百合子\n力量的莉绪，终于赶到了这里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "2bd85fe1dcc2ee6f428bb88cab78bbb0033195a476b1913879236f91e0ed3a0e", "ja": "その手には、かつて高木博士から託された\nアミュレットが握られていた！", "zh": "她手中紧握着曾经受高木博士托付的护符！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "f16053a8c0972249989126bfb2a4667f1de6fd2ae9e847e96ae3ed7f8e5a59a7", "ja": "ようやく見つけたわ。もし……もしも貴女に、\n戦う覚悟があるのなら。……これを使って、ヒーロー！", "zh": "终于找到你了。如果……要是你做好了\n战斗的觉悟。……就用这个吧，英雄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1036_026yur", "source_sha256": "2ff28f08737823a67d9ce66e7b0d6d1b8193d9b4a48033ae6d6e26c1cead88b2", "ja": "！！　このアミュレットは……\nどんどん力が湧き上がってくる！", "zh": "！！　这个护身符……\n力量正源源不断地涌上来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1037_010azu", "source_sha256": "7daf567968ffefce44a5a40b223fcc2f370dc4bdc43657767b8ed2608078759f", "ja": "！！　莉緒ちゃん！？", "zh": "！！莉绪！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1038_046rio", "source_sha256": "b3b59decbe0da14a46986d14b4de59044fc9387d412a75fe423b7819904c6e58", "ja": "ごめんなさい、あずさちゃん。\nでも私は、必要なことだと思う。", "zh": "对不起，梓。\n但我觉得这是必要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1039_046rio", "source_sha256": "4f88ddb8c8f54969fc327fe0eb8e51d51a584f720ae6a08eb0ce3a375a2e1a5f", "ja": "誰しも必ず、戦う時が来るんだから！\nあずさちゃん、貴女みたいに！", "zh": "每个人终究都会有必须奋战的时候！\n就像你一样，小梓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1041_026yur", "source_sha256": "481d75a57f6ab9810b0c6bba571965c4b2cca6af7bd091f068127cc4bf53d5d7", "ja": "私も戦える……ううん、戦いたい。愛と正義のために！\n私に守る力があるなら、私は、戦います！", "zh": "我也能战斗……不对，我想要战斗。为了爱与正义！如果我拥有守护他人的力量，我就会战斗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1042_026yur", "source_sha256": "6b3689aa549c5822321e390ab0cfb16b510d5aa7f1e89925c58afb1cfa03d8b5", "ja": "ああああああーーーっ！！！！", "zh": "啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1043_026yur", "source_sha256": "1bc28957002154b4f9489f5ff1f521381dfe747e59243137832125154c9d499a", "ja": "百合子の全細胞が沸騰し、熱い力が全身を駆け巡る。\nアミュレットは百合子のスーツとなるのだ！", "zh": "百合子的所有细胞都沸腾了，炽热的力量在全身奔涌。\n护符将化作百合子的战衣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1044_026yur", "source_sha256": "409881c674bc0e8a1b05198998ea0bb23a9a819511ac3596bef8d02a0348ec2a", "ja": "私は！！　マイティセーラー百合子！！", "zh": "我就是！！强袭水手百合子！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1045_044miz", "source_sha256": "feef1909b108665ee508f73026c0db82c7b9c8ff371cdb89a78d5b94e1efd8b7", "ja": "おや、ヒーローとして目覚めてしまいましたか。\nこれは残念。ですが……まだ孵りたてのヒナ同然。", "zh": "哎呀，已经觉醒成英雄了吗。\n真遗憾。不过……还和刚孵化的小鸡一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1046_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8b036bbd755f79df094210a3e01d48024dd673399d2b6f9197a2fb00e09e6a5", "ja": "きゃっ！　ま、まだ、パワーがうまく扱えない……！", "zh": "呀！还、还不能很好地控制这股力量……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "e286c77290cd311d2856b16f310f116031822e29950bea5fd72732728c0fd796", "ja": "翻弄される百合子。だが、懸命に戦おうとする姿は、\nあずさの中に新たな覚悟を芽生えさせた！", "zh": "被力量玩弄于股掌之间的百合子。然而，她拼尽全力想要战斗的身影，却让梓心中萌生了新的觉悟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1048_010azu", "source_sha256": "ef2f8399704e0bcc30c9ee268a798f3f7d53230e4e3601cc54e35f5bef998436", "ja": "……ありがとう。私が導くわ。\n私と貴女のキネティックパワーをともに合わせて。", "zh": "……谢谢你。由我来引导。\n将我与你的动能汇聚在一起吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1049_026yur", "source_sha256": "6f9c05466c1c4bc0ed14d775118ef967aafec368dd25c760276c61f8ac517cdb", "ja": "は、はい！\nキネティックパワー……アクセラレート……", "zh": "是、是！\n动能……加速……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1050_026yur", "source_sha256": "98227116be85f5ab795f7564aaf1de84d5426dc60a204e753acc6d240fe3cbf6", "ja": "（すごい、内側から力があふれてくる！）", "zh": "（好厉害，力量正从身体内部不断涌出来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1051_026yur", "source_sha256": "f237906959b231b5948257147788c8ccfccb4e6edb26f05b0724c2ef19793f6d", "ja": "行きます！　キネティックジャスティス！！", "zh": "出击！　动能正义！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1052_010azu", "source_sha256": "894bff95584b2108a78f56442eb977c666398f1266e6ea4004ccb68e877bbcee", "ja": "行くわよ！　キネティックジャスティス！！", "zh": "要上了！动力正义！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1053_044miz", "source_sha256": "e1127a210a285a30a9de7a297704c86962d8568aaf19f780cedaf4f2f2ea3a48", "ja": "あ。", "zh": "啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1054_se", "source_sha256": "a4b98a029db5df72cfed9eeafc4592fc9975515fcc87d861989bfdf1dcafb56e", "ja": "ドガアアアアァァァーーーーン！！！", "zh": "轰——————！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1055_026yur", "source_sha256": "25e2585b77fa97b7888c79a0f3605764bb901c5699c322fa3a13aae1eee62315", "ja": "こうしてジョーカー卿を退けた百合子は、\n新たなマイティセーラー、新たなヒーローとなった！", "zh": "就这样，击退了Joker卿的百合子，成为了新的Mighty Sailor，也成为了新的英雄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1056_026yur", "source_sha256": "6a37dae4249ffee11b22335e1d6b62f2b75eea6a95fbff562d52d96567353d9f", "ja": "ジョーカー卿が倒れて生命力を取り戻した高木は、\n政財界のコネでアイドルヒーローズの組織を拡大する。", "zh": "击倒Joker卿、恢复了生命力的高木，凭借政商界的人脉扩大了偶像英雄们的组织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1057_026yur", "source_sha256": "c66973bd5595978165c844acee40a6e81d4fc6ff486b90bb589c934f03e3704d", "ja": "同時にジョーカー卿との戦いで負傷したあずさは、\n一線を退き、最前線を百合子に託すことになる。", "zh": "与此同时，在与Joker卿的战斗中负伤的梓\n退居二线，将最前线托付给了百合子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1058_010azu", "source_sha256": "c2cb76c763a8fd68dfb95701c4419425aa9379eebd621b426a53a6a8c9608c77", "ja": "足を引っ張らないよう、これからは裏方に回るわ。\n「ザ・ファースト」としてね。", "zh": "为了不拖后腿，接下来我会转到幕后。以“THE FIRST”的身份。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1059_026yur", "source_sha256": "ef3409064dbbec59f10a6cb53a10b60d950bb55d8175ca422c22c8f579b0fe1a", "ja": "私が最前線のヒーロー……わ、わかりました！\nデストルドーの野望は、私が打ち砕いてみせます！", "zh": "我来担任最前线的英雄……好、好的！\n德斯特鲁多的野心，就由我来粉碎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1060_026yur", "source_sha256": "00f07f48598953c69b2fc7be95771e09ca725340e2634e672d090b22e845afb8", "ja": "そう、物語はまだ始まったばかりなのだ。戦え、\nヒーロー達。世界からすべての暴力を駆逐する日まで！", "zh": "没错，故事才刚刚开始。战斗吧，\n英雄们。直到将世界上的一切暴力驱逐的那一天！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0410_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0410_story_05_1061_026yur", "source_sha256": "d0968920ee56141d0c648b980433341036186a97561c577e8fb535b184d6c7d8", "ja": "次回『戦士のバカンス！　日本海がトロピカル！』\n……え、これ、もしかして水着回っていうのですか！？", "zh": "下回《战士的假期！日本海变得热带风情！》\n……咦，这难道就是所谓的泳装回吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
